+## Remaining work
+
+- Waypipe. Test the guest to host path with a running guest. The host and guest halves are in place.
+- Flatpak. Build the bundle on a host with flatpak-builder. The manifest is complete and the archives are verified.
+
+## Names and detail
+
+- Done. usb.names resolves a vendor and product ID through /usr/share/hwdata/usb.ids.
+- Done. virt.PCIName resolves a PCI ID through /usr/share/hwdata/pci.ids.
+- Done. The device rows show the human name as the title and the machine ID as the subtitle.
+- Done. The controller list drops the revision text. The combo row shows the address as the subtitle.
+- Done. The package step reports the current package name and the package count.
+- Done. The Progress panel hides its action group once the install settles.
+
+## Lessons
+
+- Do not start an installer to test the Progress panel. Reuse an installed machine instead. An install takes about fifteen minutes.
+- A 0-byte disk file must be reallocated. The launcher now treats an empty file as absent.
+- The page refreshers must run only on change. A rebuild on every tick exhausts the purego callback table.
